   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## starter 03 \u00b7 director playground\n\n**You need:** nothing (the diffuse button in the window can use Klein 4B if installed).\n\n**Do:**\n1. Queue: the director shows the facade and waits (flow: hold until apply).\n2. **open director** on node 2: **+ layer \u2192 ellipse**, then in the inspector **+ behaviour \u2192 orbit** or **wiggle**;\n   drop an mp3 on the window (\u266a audio) and add **pulse on beats**; clip a layer to regions with the R tool.\n3. **apply**: the workflow runs on and saves an mp4 with the sound.\n\n**Then try:** export from the window (export button: ProRes / PNG / H.264); a colour grade layer clipped to the\nwindows; your own facade photo in place of node 1.\n"
   ],
   "title": "read me"
  }
